message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "loadcast: synthetic multi-carrier industrial energy demand profiles"
abstract: >-
  Generates hourly heat, cold and electricity demand for an industrial site
  from a handful of observable inputs, with the correlation and the lag between
  carriers as explicit parameters rather than artefacts of the construction.
type: software
